  "schema:description": "SAFER-COVID provided a set of self-management tools to consumers to track symptoms, test results, vaccine record, and environmental factors such as exposure to others. Consumers could choose to integrate data from wearables and EHR records for self-management. These data were used to enable multiple use cases such as return-to-work, activity risk assessment, and self-management within SAFER-COVID.",
